import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms | The Royal House of Engagement" description="Purchase, shipping, and return terms for Low Value Content.">
  <article class="plain-page">
    <header><p class="eyebrow">Effective November 21, 2026</p><h1>Website terms.</h1><p>Low Value Content is an imprint of Nelson Grey LLC. These terms apply to purchases made through this website.</p></header>
    <div class="rows">
    <section><h2>Orders and payment</h2><p>Prices are shown in US dollars. You can review the item price, $5.99 per-order US shipping charge, and any applicable tax before placing an order in secure Stripe Checkout. An order is accepted when payment succeeds; we may cancel and refund an order if an item cannot be produced or shipped.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Made to order</h2><p>Shirts are printed after an order is placed. Product images may be digital previews; colors and print placement can vary slightly from a screen preview. Check the size and shipping address before paying. We currently ship only to US addresses. Tracking is available through the order status link when the carrier provides it.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Returns and problems</h2><p>See <a href="/returns.html">Returns and replacements</a> for the full policy. If a shirt does not fit, you can return it within 30 days of delivery for a refund of the item price, or exchange it for another size. Email <a href="mailto:support@lowvaluecontent.com">support@lowvaluecontent.com</a> first and we will send return instructions. Shirts must be unworn and unwashed; you pay return shipping, and original shipping is not refunded. If an item arrives damaged, misprinted, or different from what you ordered, email <a href="mailto:support@lowvaluecontent.com">support@lowvaluecontent.com</a> within 30 days of delivery. Include your order status link and a photo of the problem. We will arrange a replacement or refund. This policy does not limit any rights you have under applicable law.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Creative material</h2><p>Site copy, artwork, and designs are owned by Nelson Grey LLC or used with permission. Copyright © 2026 Nelson Grey LLC. Do not reproduce them as merchandise without written permission.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Site use</h2><p>Do not interfere with the site, attempt unauthorized access, or disrupt its services. We may correct errors in product descriptions or prices and update the site. Changes to these terms apply to orders placed after the updated terms are posted.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Contact</h2><p>For an order or these terms, email <a href="mailto:support@lowvaluecontent.com">support@lowvaluecontent.com</a>.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
